{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f7e97fe708ed568ec73dc55f65a6c566b89857483c637450a407f2154653e55", "ja": "（あずささんと、泊まりがけでロケに来ている。\n今日の仕事は……この資料を渡せば終わりだな）", "zh": "（和应梓小姐一起来外地进行过夜取景。今天的工作……只要把这份资料交出去就结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "b97c1eb088b0c7e5e251238e799b94a2779763beee037e2ff7998cbfe91beda7", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん。あら、\nわざわざ部屋まで……ありがとうございます。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。哎呀，您还特意送到房间来……谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1002_p", "source_sha256": "14d710c0079842a6078be0d43020b818d5f08526592646bd79eb67631b28bd4e", "ja": "いえいえ、これも仕事ですからね。……あれ？\nなんだか、すごくいい匂いが……？", "zh": "不客气，这也是工作嘛。……咦？\n总觉得，有股好香的味道……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "18369fb561cce32368b8f2a973f5380adf391de54529ee8df6332e1581df3ae1", "ja": "あっ。うふふ、気づきました？　このお部屋、珍しく\nミニキッチンがついてたので、少しお料理を……。", "zh": "啊。呵呵，你闻到了吗？这间房间难得\n配了个小厨房，所以我就稍微做了点菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "35aa5e95a69f2cda7be46fdd34a32424f9e172b29b8092eb722b9765e1543a00", "ja": "そうだ。もうお食事はお済みですか？\nもしまだでしたら……ご一緒にいかがでしょう？", "zh": "对了，您已经用过餐了吗？\n如果还没有……要不要一起吃点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1005_p", "source_sha256": "08569064fd40ddcce1ea8b97b63be2f89b718cb940d6e4c6f9dc1310c6b15cb6", "ja": "え、食事はまだですが……いいんですか？\nじゃあ、お言葉に甘えさせてもらおうかな。", "zh": "诶，我还没吃饭……可以吗？\n那我就恭敬不如从命了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a516a1e8961d15cb144fe7ff94063e3931d60322a55b22ee84319838d381f811", "ja": "あずささん、ごちそうさまでした。どの料理も\n本当に美味しくて、ついおかわりまで……。", "zh": "あずさ小姐，谢谢您的款待。每道菜都真的很好吃，一不小心还添了饭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "cbcc5aaa50977f2fd0bc6e31468200390a140e0ac64dcf0696b430cc359df368", "ja": "いえいえ～、喜んでいただけたなら嬉しいです♪\n私もつられて、今日はちょっと食べ過ぎちゃいました。", "zh": "不用客气～，您能喜欢我就很开心了♪\n我也受了感染，今天有点吃多了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "e4c9442d031c1c801222f0666368a32212e5470e203dbb5b31f10bc775d66db4", "ja": "でも、やっぱりいいものですね。自分の作ったごはんを\n目の前で美味しいって食べてもらえるのは……。", "zh": "不过，果然还是很棒呢。能看到别人当着我的面，吃着我做的饭菜还说好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "ae535d565874d58e7e6bf20b42c2733f1da0db1ba20b5790dc87394db7fc7588", "ja": "普段、こういう機会ってないですし。\nご一緒してくださって、ありがとうございました♪", "zh": "平时也没什么机会这样呢。\n谢谢您陪我一起用餐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ba3f2ad59c6fab158d480223d01267243bc8c695539c49052a022bafd70bcac7", "ja": "いやいや、お礼を言うのはこっちですよ！　あずささん\nさえよければ、またぜひお願いしたいくらいです。", "zh": "哪里哪里，该道谢的是我才对！梓小姐要是不介意的话，我甚至还想下次也务必拜托您呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "7d3c90725fbcfe1cebdf13d212ae15b819f4e81409010f7861c3db1cfc31e957", "ja": "あら、本当ですか？　それなら、さっそくですけど\n明日もこんな感じで、いかがですか？", "zh": "啊，真的吗？那样的话，虽然有点突然，\n明天也像今天这样，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "3b0f8372489632ef511fd515133f4140ea7d7137c6f0fb899a48e361ed52fd09", "ja": "明日は撮影が早めに終わる予定ですし、もう少し\n凝ったお料理にも挑戦しようと思ってたんです～。", "zh": "明天预定会早点结束拍摄，所以我还想着要不要挑战一下更精致的料理呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1013_p", "source_sha256": "34d50b789928c91072a835f2ec93f4325de9068340285429b7ced44a1a24d959", "ja": "そういうことでしたら、ぜひ。って、でも……\nご馳走になるばっかりでは申し訳ないな。", "zh": "既然这样，那就拜托你了。不过……总是让你请客，我也过意不去啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "54548672bf91264d6ff05739a205af421594e13e3f96b77552aaa602b489f7f8", "ja": "私から誘ったんですから。{$P$}さん\nは気になさらなくて大丈夫ですよ？", "zh": "是我邀请您的嘛。{$P$}先生\n不用放在心上的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1015_p", "source_sha256": "853e7f171f4adbe91ab2e1d9eadae70150fbe6df1cfb498f0605f45653c2785c", "ja": "いえ、そうですね……。買い出しとか、せめて調理の\n手伝いとかさせてください！　逆に迷惑かもですが。", "zh": "不，话是这么说……买东西或是帮忙做菜，\n起码让我打个下手吧！虽然搞不好反而会添乱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "26281bb4021dfab09d74438416bc91b8ab35db54846fe902eca17d56c9e506a0", "ja": "そんな、迷惑だなんて……。\nむしろ、そんな。いいんですか？　お手伝いとか……。", "zh": "怎么会，怎么能说是添麻烦呢……\n倒是……真的可以吗？让我帮忙什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "57d4bcee70b0d47675f62dcfa0e00d16ca813f533bb290ea42eee88888da83ae", "ja": "だって……{$P$}さんと一緒に\nお買い物して、キッチンに立つなんて……うふふふふ♪", "zh": "因为……能和{$P$}先生一起买东西，还一起下厨……呵呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3083bf63b3d63324c4a85a4245229a5b15a3e1b3a38b461e645f840af3247729", "ja": "…………あずささん？", "zh": "…………梓小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0324_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "0a4d79b87b6c1b1103ed115ca41c9c8328255144e1868dab8ffa12f77ee00795", "ja": "い、いえ、なんでもありません～。　\nそれでは、明日またお声がけしますね。……ふふっ♪", "zh": "没、没什么～  \n那么，明天我再来叫您吧……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
